  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "number": 1,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "How many 1’s are there in the binary representation of $2021_{10}$ ?",
        "zh": "用二进制表示十进制数 $2021_{10}$,共会出现多少个数字1?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "6",
            "zh": "6"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "7",
            "zh": "7"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "8",
            "zh": "8"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "9",
            "zh": "9"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "10",
            "zh": "10"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "$$\n2021_{10}=1024+512+256+128+64+32+4+1\n$$\n\n$$\n=1*2^{10}+1*2^{9}+1*2^{8}+1*2^{7}+1*2^{6}+1*2^{5}\n$$\n\n$$\n+0*2^{4}+0*2^{3}+1*2^{2}+0*2^{1}+1*2^{0}\n$$\n\n$$\n=11111100101_{2}\n$$\n\nThere are 8 1’s.\n\nThe eight nonzero powers are $2^{10},2^9,2^8,2^7,2^6,2^5,2^2,2^0$. Each contributes exactly one 1 bit. Count the 1 bits, not the eleven total binary digits.\n\n**Answer: C.**",
        "zh": "将十进制数写成 2 的幂之和：\n\n$$2021=1024+512+256+128+64+32+4+1.$$\n\n因此 $2021_{10}=11111100101_2$，共有 **8** 个 1。\n\n非零位对应 $2^{10},2^9,2^8,2^7,2^6,2^5,2^2,2^0$，共八个，每项贡献一个二进制 1。题目问的是 1 的个数，不是二进制表示的总位数 11。\n\n**答案：C。**"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
        "statementPages": [
          1,
          3
        ],
        "solutionSource": "solution",
        "solutionPages": [
          1
        ],
        "answerProvenance": "official"
      }
