    {
      "id": "q2",
      "number": 2,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Evaluate and express the answer in hexadecimal:\n\n$$72126_{8}-54127_{8}$$",
        "zh": "计算并将结果用十六进制表示：\n\n$$72126_{8}-54127_{8}$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "$1BFF_{16}$",
            "zh": "$1BFF_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "$1AEF_{16}$",
            "zh": "$1AEF_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "$1BFE_{16}$",
            "zh": "$1BFE_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "$1AFF_{16}$",
            "zh": "$1AFF_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "$BFF_{16}$",
            "zh": "$BFF_{16}$"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "A"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Method 1: subtract in octal, then convert to hexadecimal.\n\n$$72126_8-54127_8=15777_8=1101111111111_2=1BFF_{16}.$$\n\nMethod 2: convert both operands to hexadecimal, then subtract.\n\n$$72126_8=111010001010110_2=7456_{16},\\qquad54127_8=101100001010111_2=5857_{16}.$$\n\n$$7456_{16}-5857_{16}=1BFF_{16}.$$\n\nEach octal digit expands into three binary bits; regroup those bits in fours from the right to obtain hexadecimal. For the octal-subtraction method, a borrowed unit is worth 8 in the next column, not 10.\n\n**Answer: A.**",
        "zh": "方法一：先在八进制中相减，再转换为十六进制。\n\n$$72126_8-54127_8=15777_8=1101111111111_2=1BFF_{16}.$$\n\n方法二：把两个数分别转换为十六进制后相减。\n\n$$72126_8=111010001010110_2=7456_{16},\\qquad54127_8=101100001010111_2=5857_{16}.$$\n\n$$7456_{16}-5857_{16}=1BFF_{16}.$$\n\n每个八进制数字对应三位二进制；再从右向左每四位分组，即可转为十六进制。若先做八进制减法，向高位借的 1 在本位相当于 8，而不是 10。\n\n**答案：A。**"
      },
      "source": {
