    {
      "id": "q3",
      "number": 3,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Recursive Functions",
        "zh": "递归函数"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Find f(10) , given:\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\begin{cases} 2x+2 & \\text{if }x\\le2\\\\ f(x-1)-f(x-2) & \\text{if }x>2 \\end{cases}\n$$",
        "zh": "根据以下定义，求 $f(10)$：\n\n$$f(x)=\\begin{cases}2x+2 & x\\le 2\\\\f(x-1)-f(x-2) & x>2\\end{cases}$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "-6",
            "zh": "-6"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "-4",
            "zh": "-4"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "2",
            "zh": "2"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "4",
            "zh": "4"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "6",
            "zh": "6"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "The function evaluates as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(1)&=2\\cdot1+2=4\\qquad f(2)=2\\cdot2+2=6\\\\ f(3)&=f(2)-f(1)=2\\\\ f(4)&=f(3)-f(2)=2-6=-4\\\\ f(5)&=f(4)-f(3)=-4-2=-6\\\\ f(6)&=f(5)-f(4)=-6-(-4)=-2\\\\ f(7)&=f(6)-f(5)=-2-(-6)=4\\\\ f(8)&=f(7)-f(6)=4-(-2)=6\\\\ f(9)&=f(8)-f(7)=6-4=2\\\\ f(10)&=f(9)-f(8)=2-6=-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe sequence of numbers repeats: 4, 6, 2, -4, -6, -2, ...\n\n**Answer: B.**",
        "zh": "从初始值开始依次计算：\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}f(1)&=4,&f(2)&=6,\\\\f(3)&=6-4=2,&f(4)&=2-6=-4,\\\\f(5)&=-4-2=-6,&f(6)&=-6-(-4)=-2,\\\\f(7)&=-2-(-6)=4,&f(8)&=4-(-2)=6,\\\\f(9)&=6-4=2,&f(10)&=2-6=-4.\\end{aligned}$$\n\n数列按 $4,6,2,-4,-6,-2$ 的周期重复，所以答案为 $-4$。\n\n**答案：B。**"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
        "statementPages": [
          1,
          3
        ],
        "solutionSource": "solution",
        "solutionPages": [
          1
        ],
        "answerProvenance": "official"
      }
