    {
      "id": "q4",
      "number": 4,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Recursive Functions",
        "zh": "递归函数"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Find f(f(17)) , given:\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\begin{cases} 2+f(x-2) & \\text{if }x\\ge8\\\\ x-4 & \\text{if }x<8 \\end{cases}\n$$",
        "zh": "根据以下定义，求 $f(f(17))$：\n\n$$f(x)=\\begin{cases}2+f(x-2) & x\\ge 8\\\\x-4 & x<8\\end{cases}$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "9",
            "zh": "9"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "11",
            "zh": "11"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "13",
            "zh": "13"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "15",
            "zh": "15"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "1",
            "zh": "1"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "A"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Evaluate from the base case upward:\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}f(7)&=7-4=3,\\\\f(9)&=2+f(7)=5,\\\\f(11)&=2+f(9)=7,\\\\f(13)&=2+f(11)=9,\\\\f(15)&=2+f(13)=11,\\\\f(17)&=2+f(15)=13.\\end{aligned}$$\n\nTherefore, $f(f(17))=f(13)=9$.\n\nThe first call gives $f(17)=13$, but this is only the input of the outer call. The requested value is $f(13)=9$.\n\n**Answer: A.**",
        "zh": "从基本情况开始逐层计算：\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}f(7)&=7-4=3,\\\\f(9)&=2+f(7)=5,\\\\f(11)&=2+f(9)=7,\\\\f(13)&=2+f(11)=9,\\\\f(15)&=2+f(13)=11,\\\\f(17)&=2+f(15)=13.\\end{aligned}$$\n\n因此 $f(f(17))=f(13)=9$。\n\n内层先得到 $f(17)=13$，但 13 只是外层函数的输入，不能在这里停止；最终还要求 $f(13)=9$。\n\n**答案：A。**"
      },
      "source": {
