    {
      "id": "q5",
      "number": 5,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "What Does This Program Do?",
        "zh": "程序分析"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "How many different unique values do the variables a, b, c, and d take on when this program is executed?\n\n```text\na = 5 : b = 2 : c = 25 : d = 4\nif c / a > d then\n    b = b + d\nelse\n    b = b + c / a\nend if\nc = c − a * b / 2\nif (b < c) && (d < a) then\n    d = d / 4\nelse\n    a = c ^ 2 / a\nend if\nif d % a == 0 then\n    d = b + c\nend if\nif (c /2 > b) || ( b − d == a) then\n    d = 5 * d\nend if\n```",
        "zh": "执行以下程序,变量a, b, c, d共被赋予多少个不同的唯一值?\n\n```text\na = 5 : b = 2 : c = 25 : d = 4\nif c / a > d then\n    b = b + d\nelse\n    b = b + c / a\nend if\nc = c - a * b / 2\nif (b < c) && (d < a) then\n    d = d / 4\nelse\n    a = c ^ 2 / a\nend if\nif d % a == 0 then\n    d = b + c\nend if\nif (c /2 > b) || ( b - d == a) then\n    d = 5 * d\nend if\n```"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "4",
            "zh": "4"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "5",
            "zh": "5"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "6",
            "zh": "6"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "7",
            "zh": "7"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "8",
            "zh": "8"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "D"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Trace the variables in execution order:\n\n| a | b | c | d |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 5 | 2 | 25 | 4 |\n| 5 | 6 | 25 | 4 |\n| 5 | 6 | 10 | 4 |\n| 5 | 6 | 10 | 1 |\n| 5 | 6 | 10 | 1 |\n| 5 | 6 | 10 | 5 |\n\nThe distinct values that occur are 1, 2, 4, 5, 6, 10 and 25: 7 values.\n\nThe branch checks explain the trace: $25/5>4$ sets $b=6$; then $c=25-5\\cdot6/2=10$. Both $6<10$ and $4<5$ hold, so $d=1$. Since $1\\bmod5\\ne0$, the next assignment is skipped. Finally $10/2>6$ is false but $6-1=5$ is true, so the OR condition sets $d=5$. Include initial and intermediate values when counting distinct values; repeated appearances of 5 count only once.\n\n**Answer: D.**",
        "zh": "按程序执行顺序记录各变量：\n\n| a | b | c | d |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 5 | 2 | 25 | 4 |\n| 5 | 6 | 25 | 4 |\n| 5 | 6 | 10 | 4 |\n| 5 | 6 | 10 | 1 |\n| 5 | 6 | 10 | 1 |\n| 5 | 6 | 10 | 5 |\n\n出现过的不同数值是 $1,2,4,5,6,10,25$，共 **7** 个。\n\n表中各次变化由这些条件决定：$25/5>4$，所以 $b=6$；接着 $c=25-5\\cdot6/2=10$。$6<10$ 和 $4<5$ 同时成立，故 $d=1$。由于 $1\\bmod5\\ne0$，跳过下一次赋值。最后 $10/2>6$ 不成立，但 $6-1=5$ 成立，OR 条件使 $d=5$。统计不同的值时，初值和中间值都要计入，同一个 5 多次出现只算一次。\n\n**答案：D。**"
      },
